    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Mexicans are people from Mexico, where the currency is the Mexican peso. Silvano Aureoles Conejo is the current leader of Mexico. Bionico, from the region Jalisco, is a food found in Mexico and served for dessert."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Bionico is a Mexican dessert found in the region of Jalisco. Mexico's inhabitants are called 'Mexicans', their currency is the Mexican Peso and their leader is Silvano Aureoles Conejo."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "Mexicans (inhabitants of Mexico) use the peso (their currency) to buy dessert delicacies such as bionicos. Bionicos are found in the region of Jalisco which is located in Mexico. Silvano Aureoles Conejo is the leader of Mexico."
        }
